ém.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">68, 20,</span> trop grand pour que ;\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> <span class=\"grec\">ἢ ὥστε,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 14,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">m. sign.</span> ||</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fleche\"><span class=\"flechea\">E</span> <span class=\"ital\">Acc. plur. neutre, att.</span> <span class=\"grec\">μείζω,</span> <span class=\"ital\">poét. et de prose\nréc.</span> <span class=\"grec\">μείζονα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Tr.</span> <span class=\"refch\">324 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstd.</span> <span class=\"refch\">t. 1, 267,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">Ion.</span> <span class=\"grec\">μέζων,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 26,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">dor.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">μέσδων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Lyc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">19</span> ||\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Cp. réc.</span> <span class=\"grec\">μεγαλώτερος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Mund.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">μειζονώτερος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">fr. 351 ;</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">μειζότερος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">NT.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">3 Joh.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 4</span>\n(<span class=\"ital\">p.</span> <span class=\"grec\">*μεγϳων,</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">*μεγίων</span> ; <span class=\"ital\">cf.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">ὀλίζων</span> = <span class=\"grec\">*ὀλιγϳων,</span> <span class=\"grec\">*ὀλιγίων</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">de</span> <span class=\"grec\">ὀλίγος</span>)\n||</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Sup.</span> <span class=\"grec\">μέγιστος, η, ον,</span> très grand, le plus grand,\n<span class=\"ital\">c. 